  "content": "\n\n<h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/jmJ87gsb/images/527602ce254ed3b68f42d40960928767639d7760.png\" width=\"808\" height=\"444\"></h1>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><strong>关于：</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Delightful Creators&nbsp;</strong>是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 和&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>&nbsp;的附加模组，通过&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>&nbsp;添加新配方。目前新增了多种流体和配方，对整合包非常实用。</p>\n<p>Fabric 版也在此提供&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-creators-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>当前内容：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>为序列组装（Sequenced Assembly）提供新的未完成食物。</li>\n<li>新增汤、炖菜和酱汁等流体。</li>\n<li>可通过搅拌机混合食材制作流体。</li>\n<li>可将碗装满炖菜或汤。</li>\n<li>可切分南瓜派。</li>\n<li>蜂蜜和甜浆果饼干的配方。</li>\n<li>巧克力派的配方。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>本地化：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>英文 (en_us)&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Flomik\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flomik</a></li>\n<li>俄文 (ru_ru) -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Flomik\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flomik</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fclients%252faff.php%253faff%253d6136\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4JkTnRF/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
